<style>
  .panel-root { flex-direction: column; width: 62; padding-top: 2.4; padding-bottom: 2.4; padding-left: 2.8; padding-right: 2.8; background-color: #0b0d12f4; border-color: #B8A6EC; border-width: 0.1; border-radius: 0.5; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 1.3; font-weight: 700; color: #B8A6EC; margin-bottom: 0.5; }
  .heading { font-size: 2.4; font-weight: 700; color: #EEE9DF; margin-bottom: 0.7; }
  .hint { font-size: 1.6; color: #b9b5ab; margin-bottom: 1; }
  .btn { width: 100%; height: 3.8; background-color: #B8A6EC; border-radius: 0.4; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #0b0d12; font-size: 1.7; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 0.7; }
  .btn-collapse { width: 100%; height: 3.2; background-color: #1c2029; border-radius: 0.4; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #EEE9DF; font-size: 1.5; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 0.7; }
  .result { font-size: 1.7; color: #EEE9DF; margin-top: 0.4; }
</style>
<div class="panel-root" id="counterfactual-root" style="display: none">
  <span class="eyebrow">COUNTERFACTUAL CHAMBER - sealed, never executed</span>
  <span class="heading">Compare two worlds</span>
  <span class="hint" id="cf-hint">exclusion needs no login; containment effect needs an operator session - MNEME's authority gate decides, not this panel</span>
  <button class="btn" id="cf-exclusion">Exclusion forecast (mem-gate)</button>
  <button class="btn" id="cf-containment">Containment effect (mem-poison)</button>
  <button class="btn-collapse" id="cf-collapse">Collapse chamber</button>
  <span class="result" id="cf-result">​</span>
</div>
